    {
      "uid": "zhcn:507fefe5498db5e1fc6a01f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我现在没有优先考虑兴趣的余力……",
      "source_fingerprint": "31d87a6540e7880aeda7e81dc67bf6199498e5163f693761d8296376fec7a577",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1133/storytimeline_501133115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bda87bb01370cbd304bc602",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "都到了这个地步，怎么说也不能放着她不管。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bb97069933053f94bef28f8e7fa178efaab1d96a9c9f1152d372854d0984937",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1133/storytimeline_501133115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bc655700da858abc663d285",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的强项是爆发力以及战术预判能力。\n因为看过很多比赛，\n能自然而然地预判最佳走向。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cabac3e0e7a74f24e154f38fcff37559330e9cc0eb1bf84c0b5a1b75ca301b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1133/storytimeline_501133115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ac0df14b1264445fb715667",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是看不清周围，就无法预测展开。\n她现在因为焦虑而变得视野狭窄，\n这会导致长处无法发挥。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfebeb9fb56df1377a3b719b4a8822987cde0185a39a170c5af617d9a6b4812f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1133/storytimeline_501133115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b53effabc1bf2a3c6b7759f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "通过观战『宝冢纪念』，\n希望她能找回对赛跑史的热情——\n找回自己的风采。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba8e83337051471c368bc5cf8674e6cac6fbc697da15d7e0397c34cafabf2547",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1133/storytimeline_501133115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3445860d01ecb0bf89fe9267",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——而且『宝冢纪念』的参赛者中\n还有那位马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74618eb564b2b03824fab6917d9fb908aac7ceb1ac064b862cbffbe3aafeb1ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
